# No /docs rule here, deliberately.
#
# Documentation is canonically at abhed.zybuu.com/docs, served by the
# abhed-docs Worker, which fetches these same files from the Pages origin. A
# redirect on /docs/* would apply to that origin too — including
# zybuu.pages.dev — so the Worker would fetch a redirect pointing back at its
# own route and loop. Verified: it did.
#
# zybuu.com/docs therefore still serves the docs directly. Two URLs for one
# set of pages is worth less than an outage, and the canonical links on the
# site all point at abhed.zybuu.com.
/demo /demo/ 301

# The product was renamed from Titan to Abhed; old links keep working.
/titan/* /abhed/:splat 301
/titan /abhed/ 301
